---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Valerio Valente | MLOps Engineer"
  description="MLOps specialist building production-grade machine learning systems"
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section id="about" class="mb-28">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
        <div class="md:w-1/3 relative">
          <div class="gradient-border rounded-full p-1 w-64 h-64 mx-auto">
            <img src="/images/me1.jpg" alt="Valerio Valente professional portrait"
              class="rounded-full w-full h-full object-cover">
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-5 -right-5 bg-primary-600 text-dark-900 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-mono text-sm font-bold">
            Data Scientist | AI Engineer
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-2/3">
          <h1 class="text-5xl text-primary-500 font-bold mb-4">Valerio <span class="text-primary-50">Valente</span></h1>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-primary-400 mb-6 font-mono">$ whoami</h2>
          <div class="terminal-style p-6 mb-6 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-lg mb-4">I build AI systems that survive contact with reality.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400">
              If your idea of fun is digging into the messy details instead of waving hands at slide decks, we’re
              already friends.
              I spend most of my time turning data and machine learning into things that actually work outside a Jupyter
              notebook, which is where most “AI” quietly goes to die.

              When I’m not doing that, I’m either outside pretending I have a balanced life, reading something I can’t
              put down, or deep into a manga binge I’ll regret the next morning.
              I also make sourdough, which is just controlled fermentation dressed up as a hobby. Bread, pizza, anything
              involving yeast, I’m irrationally into it.

              Want proof I don’t just talk big? Check the <a href="#projects" class="text-primary-400 hover:text-primary-500 transition"><b>work</b></a> section.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="#contact"
              class="bg-primary-600 text-dark-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-500 transition font-bold flex items-center">
              <i class="fas fa-terminal mr-2"></i> Get in touch
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/valeriova96" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="border border-primary-600 text-primary-500 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-dark-700 transition flex items-center">
              <i class="fab fa-github mr-2"></i> Explore my GitHub
            </a>
            <a href="/files/valerio_valente_resume.pdf" download="valerio_valente_resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="border border-primary-600 text-primary-500 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-dark-700 transition flex items-center">
              <i class="fas fa-file-download mr-2"></i> Download Resume
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience Section -->
    <section id="experience" class="mb-28">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">
        <span class="text-primary-500">$</span> Professional Journey
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">

        <!-- Current Role -->
        <div class="border p-6 rounded-lg hover:border-primary-500/50 transition">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-400">Data Scientist</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400">InSilicoTrials Technologies</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-primary-900/30 text-primary-400 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-mono">
              April 2025 – Present
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Synthetic Data Generation</li>
            <li>Agentic AI and Model Context Protocol</li>
            <li>Explainable AI</li>
            <li>Production of POCs for clients</li>
            <li>Deployment and monitoring of models on Azure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Previous Roles -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

          <!-- InSilicoTrials (Junior) -->
          <div class="bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/50 transition">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-400 mb-2">Junior Data Scientist</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 mb-3">InSilicoTrials Technologies | April 2024 – April 2025</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
              <li>Dataset cleaning & model training</li>
              <li>Python packages for internal use aimed to simplify day-to-day coding AI-related</li>
              <li>Coding interviews and onboarding of new data scientists</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Miraitek -->
          <div class="bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/50 transition">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-400 mb-2">Junior Data Scientist</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 mb-3">Miraitek srl | September 2023 – April 2024</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
              <li>RAG on AWS</li>
              <li>Anomaly detection algorithms</li>
              <li>BI dashboards with SQL for manufacturing analytics</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Awards & Certifications Section -->
    <section id="achievements" class="mb-28">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">
        <span class="text-primary-500">#</span> Awards & Certifications
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Certification 1 -->
        <div
          class="cert-badge bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/30 transition">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
            <!-- Image (top on mobile, right on desktop) -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 sm:order-2">
              <img src="/images/dmlmip.jpg" alt="Deploying Machine Learning in Production Logo"
                class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full sm:w-32 h-auto">
            </div>
            <!-- Icon & Text -->
            <div class="flex-1 sm:order-1">
              <div class="flex items-start mb-4">
                <div class="text-primary-500 text-2xl mr-4">
                  <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">Deploying Machine Learning Models in Production</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Deeplearning.ai • Aug 2024</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-300">
                <a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/verify/OC06EOAHREQU" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-primary-200 hover:text-primary-500">Credential ID
                  OC06EOAHREQU</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">MLOps</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Python</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Certification 2 -->
        <div
          class="cert-badge bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/30 transition">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
            <!-- Image (top on mobile, right on desktop) -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 sm:order-2">
              <img src="/images/mlip.jpg" alt="Machine Learning in Production Logo"
                class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full sm:w-32 h-auto">
            </div>
            <!-- Icon & Text -->
            <div class="flex-1 sm:order-1">
              <div class="flex items-start mb-4">
                <div class="text-primary-500 text-2xl mr-4">
                  <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">Machine Learning in Production</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Deeplearning.ai • May 2024</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-300">
                <a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/verify/96CN9B7M28XA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-primary-200 hover:text-primary-500">Credential ID
                  96CN9B7M28XA</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">MLOps</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Python</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Award 1 -->
        <div
          class="cert-badge bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/30 transition">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
            <!-- Image (top on mobile, right on desktop) -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 sm:order-2">
              <img src="/images/hsftf.jpg" alt="Huawei Seeds For The Future Logo"
                class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full sm:w-32 h-auto">
            </div>
            <!-- Icon & Text -->
            <div class="flex-1 sm:order-1">
              <div class="flex items-start mb-4">
                <div class="text-primary-500 text-2xl mr-4">
                  <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">Huawei Seeds For The Future Finalist</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Huawei • November 2021</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-300"><a
                  href="https://magazine.unibo.it/archivio/2021/12/17/team-con-studenti-unibo-vincitore-al-seeds-for-the-future"
                  target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-200 hover:text-primary-500">Read the article</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Cross Functional Team</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Agile</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Proactivity</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Certification 3 -->
        <div
          class="cert-badge bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/30 transition">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
            <!-- Image (top on mobile, right on desktop) -->
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 sm:order-2">
              <img src="/images/rag.jpg" alt="Introduction to Retrieval Augmented Generation Logo"
                class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full sm:w-32 h-auto">
            </div>
            <!-- Icon & Text -->
            <div class="flex-1 sm:order-1">
              <div class="flex items-start mb-4">
                <div class="text-primary-500 text-2xl mr-4">
                  <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">Introduction to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Duke University • Aug 2024</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-300"><a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/verify/UT2G2PAI109Z"
                  target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-200 hover:text-primary-500">Credential ID UT2G2PAI109</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Python</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">RAG</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">LLM</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Llamaindex</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Section -->
    <section id="projects" class="mb-28">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">
        <span class="text-primary-500">></span> Selected Work
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Project 1 -->
        <div
          class="project-card bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/50 transition h-full flex flex-col">
          <div class="mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
            <img src="/images/llmmamcp.jpg" alt="multi-agent system using model context protocol (MCP)"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">LLM Multi-Agents</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 flex-grow">Developed and contributed to several LLM-based systems, including a
            multi-agent
            one featuring a <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/model-context-protocol" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-primary-300 hover:text-primary-500">Model Context Protocol (MCP)</a> server serving
            specialized tools.
            For one of them I contributed to a famous GitHub repo <a href="https://github.com/grll/mcpadapt"
              target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary-300 hover:text-primary-500">mcpadapt</a>
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">LLM</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">RAG</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">MCP</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">LlamaIndex</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Agentic AI</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2 -->
        <div
          class="project-card bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/50 transition h-full flex flex-col">
          <div class="mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
            <img src="/images/mlops.jpg" alt="FDA's recognition" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">FDA's Recognition</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 flex-grow">Recognized as a top 5 performer in a <a
              href="https://precision.fda.gov/challenges/34/results" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-primary-300 hover:text-primary-500">FDA’s challenge</a>, representing
            my company and demonstrating excellence in deploying RAG solutions under regulatory standards.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Python</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">RAG</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Regulatory Compliance</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 3 -->
        <div
          class="project-card bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-dark-700 hover:border-primary-500/50 transition h-full flex flex-col">
          <div class="mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
            <img src="/images/pocs.jpg" alt="Predictive maintenance dashboard" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">POCs Creation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 flex-grow">Developed several POCs for clients providing minimum viable product
            and aligning with non-technical stakeholders.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Python</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Streamlit</span>
            <span class="bg-dark-700 text-primary-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded">Docker</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <section id="contact" class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">
        <span class="text-primary-500">~</span> Let's Connect
      </h2>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mb-8">
        <a href="https://github.com/valeriova96" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="GitHub profile (opens in new tab)"
          class="text-2xl text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="fab fa-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/valerio-valente/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="LinkedIn profile (opens in new tab)"
          class="text-2xl text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="fab fa-linkedin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="https://medium.com/@valeriovalente96" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Medium profile (opens in new tab)"
          class="text-2xl text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="fab fa-medium" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-dark-800 rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto gradient-border">
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/movlqqpz" method="POST">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <label for="name" class="block text-gray-300 mb-2">Name</label>
            <input type="text" name="name" id="name" required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-dark-700 border border-dark-600 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 text-white">
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <label for="email" class="block text-gray-300 mb-2">Email</label>
            <input type="email" name="email" id="email" required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-dark-700 border border-dark-600 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 text-white">
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <label for="message" class="block text-gray-300 mb-2">Message</label>
            <textarea name="message" id="message" rows="5" required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-dark-700 border border-dark-600 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 text-white"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <label class="inline-flex items-start space-x-2">
              <input type="checkbox" name="privacy" required class="mt-1">
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">
                I agree to the
                <a href="/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400">
                  Privacy Policy
                </a>
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <button type="submit"
            class="bg-primary-600 text-dark-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-500 transition font-bold">
            Send Message
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
